{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Throw A Life!</strong> is a chaotic party survival game for up to four players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to mine, craft, build, and hunt on a dangerous island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divide roles to survive efficiently\u2014or embrace the chaos and have fun with friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive as long as you can!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teamwork is essential to endure the harsh survival challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divide tasks like mining, crafting, building, and hunting wisely to make it through!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026But beware of hunger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443790/extras/a32ea2af2875d33220b05bd7648a50db.poster.avif?t=1771368215\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443790/extras/a32ea2af2875d33220b05bd7648a50db.webm?t=1771368215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443790/extras/a32ea2af2875d33220b05bd7648a50db.mp4?t=1771368215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prepare for enemy surprise attack!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hurry... The enemy attacks at night!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft weapons and build your base before night falls to prepare for the enemy's surprise attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443790/extras/5fd334a65dd9c0fdf154a816fefd17a2.poster.avif?t=1771368215\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443790/extras/5fd334a65dd9c0fdf154a816fefd17a2.webm?t=1771368215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443790/extras/5fd334a65dd9c0fdf154a816fefd17a2.mp4?t=1771368215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defeat bosses and earn rewards!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive tough boss battles or defeat bosses to earn rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show your teamwork and use a variety of weapons to fight the boss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443790/extras/698c079ed4a428b26d1783f9338a1baa.poster.avif?t=1771368215\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443790/extras/698c079ed4a428b26d1783f9338a1baa.webm?t=1771368215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443790/extras/698c079ed4a428b26d1783f9338a1baa.mp4?t=1771368215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 10 unique items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local cooperative multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic boss battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High difficulty survival</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3443790?t=1771368215","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443790/76cc0e9edf45b3bd9f17c5fe92f847279f0d119d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771368215","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443790/9587e567275c6751b0a9b90fbf0